@model List<WastetransportationViewModel>
@using CPC02.Models
@using Newtonsoft.Json
@{ decimal transport = 0; decimal transport1 = 0; decimal totalEmission = 0; }
<table class="table table-striped table-bordered table-hover">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>廢棄物代碼</th>
            <th>中間處理方式</th>
            <th>每趟運輸公里</th>
            <th>
                總噸數
            </th>
            <th>
                係數
            </th>
            <th>
                廢棄物運輸計算結果
            </th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        @foreach (var item in Model)
        {
            <tr>
                <td>@item.code</td>
                <td>@item.methods</td>
                <td>
                    @{
                        transport = 0;

                        switch (item.code)
                        {
                            case "D-2406":
                            case "D-1801":
                            case "D-2399":
                                transport = 2.46m;
                                break;

                            case "D-2499":
                                transport = 43.6m;
                                break;
                        }
                    }

                    @if (transport != 0)
                    {
                        <div class="text-center">
                            <span>@transport.ToString("F2")</span><br />
                        </div>
                    }
                </td>

                <td>@(item.SumDECLAREDWEIGHT?.ToString("G29") ?? "")</td>
                <td>
                    @{
                        transport1 = 0;
                        switch (item.code)
                        {
                            case "D-2499":
                            case "D-2406":
                            case "D-2399":
                                transport1 = 0.131m;
                                break;
                            case "D-1801":
                                transport1 = 1.31m;
                                break;
                        }
                        totalEmission += transport * (item.SumDECLAREDWEIGHT ?? 0m) * transport1 / 1000m;
                        if (transport1 != 0)
                        {
                            <div class="text-center">
                                <span>@transport1.ToString("F4")</span><br />
                                <span class="input-group-text">(kg CO₂e)/延噸公里(mt)</span>
                            </div>
                        }
                    }
                </td>
                <td>
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <span>@((transport * (item.SumDECLAREDWEIGHT ?? 0) * transport1 / 1000).ToString("F4"))</span><br />
                        <span class="input-group-text">tonCO₂e</span>
                    </div>

                </td>
            </tr>
        }
    </tbody>
    <tfoot><tr><th colspan="3">合計</th><td>@((Model.Sum(x => x.SumDECLAREDWEIGHT) ?? 0m).ToString("N4"))</td><td>—</td><td>@totalEmission.ToString("F4") tonCO₂e</td></tr></tfoot>
</table>
<div>
    <p> <a href="~/file/ESG/南部科學園區台南園區資源再生中心-公司路程圖.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">南部科學園區台南園區資源再生中心-公司路程圖</a></p>
    <p><a href="~/file/ESG/大寧掩埋場-公司路程圖.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">大寧掩埋場-公司路程圖</a></p>
</div>
